acceptance_criteria: Capture actual Windows resolver status signal and duration with the same child environment and working directory; Separate confirmed command absence from unavailable proof without trusting arbitrary child diagnostics; Retain bounded lookup behavior native exit status exact stderr and installed-child127 or ENOENT negative controls
